# Lays one file into the folder of THIS run. The writing itself is done
# by the console, so there is exactly ONE writer and one place to improve.
# Returns the FULL PATH on success and an empty string on failure, with
# the reason in $why. Name every file you write in the protocol, with its
# line count - that rule is what keeps the log row true on its own.
# env_class v1 (2026-08-29).
If iOk
Else
	Quit method ''
End If
Set reference ref to $clib.$classes.ExecutorConsole.$insts().$first()
If isclear(ref)
	Calculate iWhy as 'the console has gone away since this run started'
	Quit method ''
End If
Calculate note as ref.$writeRunFile(pName,pText)
If len(note)
	Calculate iWhy as note
	Quit method ''
End If
Quit method con(iPath,pName)